gork (0.8~beta) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New setting protocol = openai: gork can speak the OpenAI chat
    completions format (llama.cpp, Ollama, vLLM, OpenAI and services
    shaped like it) as well as the Messages API.  The key is then sent as
    Authorization: Bearer and comes from OPENAI_API_KEY, not
    ANTHROPIC_API_KEY.  Untested: it has only been run against a fake
    server, never a real one.
  * Newly verified, both passing the test suite: macOS 26 on arm64 and
    Cygwin 3.6 on Windows.  GitHub Actions builds and tests both on every
    push.
  * Test suite: a new check for the OpenAI protocol, and the skills check
    no longer fails where the temporary directory is a symbolic link.

